  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 16 00}Lately,{01 00 00 05 00} when I've been\nspacing out on my couch...\n\n{07 09 00}I start to draw pictures of\n{04 13 00} before I\nrealize it{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 16 00}Do you think this{01 00 00 05 00} is a sign\nof something,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Hey!{01 00 00 05 00}{01 00 00 05 00} {0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{01 01 00} Are you{01 00 00 05 00}\nseriously trying to make me\ntake a quiz, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 04 00}Huh? What are you talking\nabout?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}I'm asking you if you're\nserious about which of\nthese things is different!\n{07 15 00}'Cause lemme tell you{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} If\nthis is some kind of\ncontest, I'll put up a fight!\n{07 05 00}But if it's just pickin' on\nlittle weaklings,{01 00 00 05 00} I'll HATE it!\n\n{07 15 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 04 00} Are you gonna\nlet this fly,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}?{09 01 00}{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{02 00 00 06 08}\nNever!\nLet what fly?",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 02 00}{09 01 00}{07 1d 00}{09 02 00}{07 04 00}Oh!{01 00 00 14 00} That's the spirit,{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}!\n\n{09 01 00}{09 07 00}{09 02 00}{07 14 00}Now peace will reign in\n{ff 00 00 08}{04 03 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{01 01 00} {07 03 00}Yeah, it'll\nRAIN! Ah har har!{09 09 00}",
