   "en": "{09 02 00}{07 05 00}Idiots! {01 00 00 0a 00}Both of you!\n\n\n{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 15 00}Your hemming and hawing\nis going to ruin this town,{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 02 00}!\n{09 01 00}{07 02 00}{09 02 00}{09 05 00}You gotta let {ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}\nhave it!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
