  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 04 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}Hmph.{01 00 00 0f 00} Just for curiosity's\nsake,{01 00 00 0a 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}{09 03 00}{09 02 00}{07 0b 00} which do you\nthink it will be?{02 00 00 0d 0d}\nHeads.\nTails.",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
